[0.01009, "o", "$ claude -p \"Use the inforce MCP tools. First call inforce_brief on demo/_live/payroll/paye.py and summarise the verdict. Then fix paye.py and its test so they follow the successor rules InForce returns, and update any other files it lists under 'also check'. After each change, run inforce_scan on demo/_live until it reports zero STALE artifacts. Do not touch demo/naira-payroll, do not commit, and cite the provisions InForce returns.\"\r\n\r\n"]
